# Guitar Freaks 2nd Mix Link Kit 2 (GC929 VER. JBB), Konami 1999: as gtrfrk2ml1-play.his, from what gtrfrk2ml2-install
# left (its NVRAM: the flash and the PC Card installed). Power-on boots from flash: FLASH-ROM CHECK
# (the whole PC Card, to frame ~6800), then attract. Two coins (one credit), then Start through the
# caution screen; the Link version's EDIT DATA screen (play edits from a memory card) is left to time
# out (NO); Start through How To Play, the mode select (NORMAL) and the music select (its default,
# GO GO AGAIN). The first stage is played as in gtrfrk2m-play.his: every 12 frames a neck chord (R,
# G, B, R+G, G+B, R+B, open) is held and picked, a wail every 240 frames; the excite gauge runs out,
# GAME OVER, and attract again. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to
# compare with MAME.
game gtrfrk2ml2

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 7800 press "Coin 1" 8
at 7850 press "Coin 1" 8
at 8200 press "1 Player Start" 8   # title: start
at 8500 press "1 Player Start" 8   # caution screen
at 9200 press "1 Player Start" 8   # How To Play (EDIT DATA timed out)
at 9500 press "1 Player Start" 8   # mode select: NORMAL
at 9800 press "1 Player Start" 8   # music select: GO GO AGAIN

# the first stage
at 10000 press "P1 Button R" 8
at 10002 press "P1 Pick" 3
at 10012 press "P1 Button G" 8
at 10014 press "P1 Pick" 3
at 10024 press "P1 Button B" 8
